### ==========================================================
### SHARED GROUPS — la salida, su gente, sus gastos y el reparto.
### Aquí NO se mueve plata del usuario: no hay cuenta, ni categoría,
### ni presupuesto. Un grupo no tiene mes: el rango sale de sus gastos.
### El sobrante del redondeo es SIEMPRE de quien pagó.
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Contactos para el grupo (éxito)
# @name createAna
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "color": "TEAL" }

###

@anaId = {{createAna.response.body.id}}

# @name createBeto
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Beto {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "color": "INDIGO" }

###

@betoId = {{createBeto.response.body.id}}

# @name createCarla
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Carla {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "color": "ROSE" }

###

@carlaId = {{createCarla.response.body.id}}

### Crear el grupo (éxito) — tú entras solo, no te nombras en contactIds
# @name createGroup
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Viaje Cartagena {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "color": "AMBER", "contactIds": ["{{anaId}}", "{{betoId}}"] }

###

@groupId = {{createGroup.response.body.id}}
@groupVersion = {{createGroup.response.body.updatedAt}}

### Un reparto por defecto no puede ser EXACT: no hay total que repartir — 400 VALIDATION
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mal defecto {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "defaultSplit": { "mode": "EXACT" } }

### Porcentajes que no suman 100 — 400 SPLIT_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mal porcentaje {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "contactIds": ["{{anaId}}"], "defaultSplit": { "mode": "PERCENT", "shares": [{ "contactId": null, "percent": 60 }, { "contactId": "{{anaId}}", "percent": 30 }] } }

### Listar los grupos — cada fila trae sus totales derivados
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Solo los grupos en los que está una persona
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups?contactId={{anaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gasto que hereda el reparto del grupo (éxito) — 100.000 entre 3 en COP: el peso suelto es tuyo
# @name createExpense
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Cena", "date": "2026-08-15T23:00:00.000Z", "amount": 100000 }

###

@expenseId = {{createExpense.response.body.id}}

### Gasto de otro mes — el grupo dura lo que duran sus gastos
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Hotel", "date": "2026-09-02T15:00:00.000Z", "amount": 600000 }

### Gasto que pagó otra persona — no es gasto tuyo; si hubiera sobrante sería de ella
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Tickets", "date": "2026-08-16T20:00:00.000Z", "amount": 90000, "paidByContactId": "{{anaId}}" }

### Gasto con reparto propio por importes exactos — queda como Custom split
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Taxi", "date": "2026-08-16T02:00:00.000Z", "amount": 60000, "split": { "mode": "EXACT", "shares": [{ "party": "USER", "fixedAmount": 40000 }, { "party": "CONTACT", "contactId": "{{anaId}}", "fixedAmount": 20000 }] } }

### Reparto «fijos y el resto» — «pepito solo paga 50»
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Almuerzo", "date": "2026-08-17T17:00:00.000Z", "amount": 150000, "split": { "mode": "FIXED_REST", "shares": [{ "party": "USER" }, { "party": "CONTACT", "contactId": "{{anaId}}", "fixedAmount": 50000 }, { "party": "CONTACT", "contactId": "{{betoId}}" }] } }

### Invitados: 3 personas + 20 invitados = 23 partes, y el bloque es UN cobro
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Fiesta", "date": "2026-08-18T23:00:00.000Z", "amount": 230000, "split": { "mode": "EQUAL", "guests": { "count": 20, "name": "La oficina" }, "shares": [{ "party": "USER" }, { "party": "CONTACT", "contactId": "{{anaId}}" }, { "party": "CONTACT", "contactId": "{{betoId}}" }, { "party": "GUESTS" }] } }

### Un bloque de invitados sin el número encima — 400 SPLIT_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Sin cabezas", "date": "2026-08-18T23:00:00.000Z", "amount": 1000, "split": { "mode": "EQUAL", "shares": [{ "party": "USER" }, { "party": "GUESTS" }] } }

### Alguien que no está en el grupo — 400 PARTICIPANT_NOT_IN_GROUP
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Ajeno", "date": "2026-08-18T23:00:00.000Z", "amount": 1000, "split": { "mode": "EQUAL", "shares": [{ "party": "USER" }, { "party": "CONTACT", "contactId": "{{carlaId}}" }] } }

### COP no tiene decimales — 400 AMOUNT_PRECISION
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Con centavos", "date": "2026-08-18T23:00:00.000Z", "amount": 1000.5 }

### Fecha a más de 24 h — 400 FUTURE_DATE
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Mañana no", "date": "2030-01-01T00:00:00.000Z", "amount": 1000 }

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### UN GASTO QUE ES UN MOVIMIENTO TUYO (T-115)
### El movimiento manda: de él salen el importe, la fecha y la
### descripción, y en él se guarda lo que cuenta como tuyo con su
### historial. Repartir no baja esa cifra: la plata ya salió.
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### Una cuenta para pagar la salida (éxito)
# @name createAccount
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bancolombia {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "type": "ACCOUNT", "balance": 5000000 }

###

@accountId = {{createAccount.response.body.id}}

### El gasto tal y como se registró esa noche (éxito)
# @name createMovement
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXPENSE", "amount": 120000, "date": "2026-08-15T23:30:00.000Z", "description": "Cena", "fromAccountId": "{{accountId}}" }

###

@movementId = {{createMovement.response.body.id}}

### Meterlo en el grupo — sin importe, fecha ni descripción: los pone el movimiento
# @name splitMovement
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transactionId": "{{movementId}}" }

###

@splitExpenseId = {{splitMovement.response.body.id}}

### El movimiento ya trae el enlace, countsAsYours y su historial (SPLIT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{movementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Meter el mismo movimiento en otro grupo — 400 TRANSACTION_ALREADY_SHARED
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transactionId": "{{movementId}}" }

### Mandar el importe con el movimiento — 400 VALIDATION: lo dice él
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transactionId": "{{movementId}}", "amount": 999 }

### Mandar la descripción con el movimiento — 400 VALIDATION: también la dice él
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transactionId": "{{movementId}}", "description": "Otra cosa" }

### Cambiar en el gasto lo que dice el movimiento — 400 SHARED_EXPENSE_LINKED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses/{{splitExpenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 150000 }

### Cambiar el importe en el movimiento — reparte otra vez y apunta AMOUNT_CHANGED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{movementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 150000 }

### Sacarlo del grupo — el movimiento vuelve a ser entero tuyo (UNSPLIT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses/{{splitExpenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Los gastos del grupo — el más nuevo primero, keyset sobre (date, id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses?limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### El grupo con su rango y sus totales, derivados de los gastos
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar el importe vuelve a repartir sobre el mismo reparto
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 120000 }

### Guardar un reparto propio en ese gasto — queda Custom split
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "split": { "mode": "PERCENT", "shares": [{ "party": "USER", "percent": 50 }, { "party": "CONTACT", "contactId": "{{anaId}}", "percent": 50 }] } }

### Volver al reparto del grupo — limpia la marca
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "useGroupSplit": true }

### Las dos cosas a la vez — 400 SPLIT_INVALID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "useGroupSplit": true, "split": { "mode": "EQUAL", "shares": [{ "party": "USER" }] } }

### Simular añadir a alguien: enseña el resultado entero SIN escribir nada
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/participants/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contactIds": ["{{carlaId}}"], "applyToExistingExpenses": true }

### Añadirla de verdad — el grupo y todos los gastos se mueven juntos
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contactIds": ["{{carlaId}}"], "applyToExistingExpenses": true }

### Añadir a alguien que ya está — 400 PARTICIPANT_ALREADY_IN_GROUP
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contactIds": ["{{anaId}}"] }

### Sacarla ahora que tiene parte en los gastos — 400 PARTICIPANT_IN_USE
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/participants/{{carlaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar el reparto por defecto — vale para lo que añadas desde ahora, nunca hacia atrás
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "defaultSplit": { "mode": "PERCENT", "shares": [{ "contactId": null, "percent": 40 }, { "contactId": "{{anaId}}", "percent": 30 }, { "contactId": "{{betoId}}", "percent": 20 }, { "contactId": "{{carlaId}}", "percent": 10 }] } }

### Update con If-Match viejo — 409 STALE_UPDATE
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: {{groupVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Viaje de ayer" }

### Borrar un gasto (soft delete) — deja de contar en todos los totales
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrarlo otra vez — IDEMPOTENTE (200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archivar el grupo — idempotente; sus gastos siguen leyéndose
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Añadir un gasto a un grupo archivado — 400 RESOURCE_ARCHIVED
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Tarde", "date": "2026-09-05T15:00:00.000Z", "amount": 1000 }

### Restaurar el grupo
POST {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Grupo ajeno o inexistente — 404 uniforme
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/019576a0-d7b6-7d6d-af6a-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cursor inventado en los gastos — 400 INVALID_CURSOR
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-groups/{{groupId}}/expenses?cursor=019576a0-d7b6-7d6d-af6a-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
